# EXPECT: Enter number of element \(0=aperture\): \[0\]: 1\s+iElt=\s+1\s+EltName=\s+gen_asphere\s+Element=\s+Reflector\s+Surface=\s+Aspheric\s+KrElt=-5\.0E\+00\s+KcElt=-1\.0E\+00\s+psiElt=\s+0\.0E\+00\s+0\.0E\+00\s+1\.0E\+00\s+VptElt=\s+0\.0E\+00\s+0\.0E\+00\s+0\.0E\+00\s+RptElt=\s+0\.0E\+00\s+0\.0E\+00\s+0\.0E\+00\s+nAsphCoef=\s+4\s+AsphCoef=\s+1\.0000\d*E-09\s+2\.0E-19\s+3\.0000\d*E-17\s+(4\.0000\d*|3\.9999\d*)E-20[\s\S]*?PropType=\s+Geometric\s+zElt=5\.0E\+00
# EXPECT: OPD: nPassRays =\s+60,\s+DAvgCumL =\s+12\.500\d*D\+00[\s\S]*?RMS OPD error is\s+1\.0356\d*D-10
